<title>THAILAND: Shinawatra Computer Q3 net rises 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Shinawatra Computer Q3 net rises 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     6.87	 vs	   5.13</p>
<p>    Net profit	     951.50	 vs	 710.45</p>
<p>				  Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	    17.39	 vs	  18.97</p>
<p>    Net profit	   2,410.15	 vs     2,629.64</p>
<p>NOTES -  Revenues not stated. Company's full name is Shinawatra Computer and Communications Plc, a computer and communications firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
